# ==============================================================================
# KEYSTORE PROPERTIES TEMPLATE (PHASE 2 PREPARATION)
# ==============================================================================
# DO NOT commit keystore.properties (with actual passwords) to GitHub!
# This file is ignored by .gitignore to keep your release signing keys private.
#
# When you are ready for Phase 2, copy this file to 'keystore.properties' or
# set these exact environment variables in your local terminal or GitHub Secrets:
#
# KEYSTORE_PATH=my-upload-key.jks
# STORE_PASSWORD=your_keystore_password_here
# KEY_ALIAS=upload
# KEY_PASSWORD=your_key_password_here
# ==============================================================================
